msgid "全连接：赤手空拳"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:4
msgid "赤手空拳——不看山体结构，20 万参数走不远。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:6
msgid "赤手空拳出发——每个像素连接每个神经元，20 万个参数，不做任何假设。很快就发现：**这山，爬不远。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:8
msgid ""
"站在 MNIST 面前。用的是攀岩的技术——每一块岩石亲手检查，不靠地形判断。784 个像素，全部连到 256 个神经元。200,960 "
"个参数。不多想，先试试。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:10
msgid "训练。看结果。**能跑，但吃力。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:12
msgid ""
"不是参数不够。攀岩的思路放到山上，天然就错了——你把岩壁当成了一堆互不相关的碎石。相邻的像素本来连在一起，偏要一个一个检查。同一个数字\"7\"出现在左边和右边，偏要学两遍。全连接不假设任何空间结构——代价就是，20"
" 万参数还爬不稳一座 28×28 的小山。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:14
msgid "先看这个工具本身。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**全连接层（Fully Connected "
"Layer）**，源于感知机（Perceptron）{cite}`rosenblatt1958perceptron`，是神经网络最基本的构建块。建议回顾{ref"
"}`activation-functions`中**线性回归→多层感知机**的演变。每个输入节点都与每个输出节点相连接——赤手空拳，不留死角。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:20
msgid "全连接层结构示意图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:41
msgid "**全连接层的数学表达**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"对于输入向量 $\\mathbf{x} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ 和输出向量 $\\mathbf{y} \\in "
"\\mathbb{R}^m$，全连接层的变换为："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{y} = \\mathbf{W}\\mathbf{x} + \\mathbf{b}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:49
#, python-brace-format
msgid "这正是{ref}`activation-functions`中提到的**线性变换** $Wx + b$ 的矩阵形式，其中："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{W} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{m \\times n}$ 是权重矩阵（所有连接）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{b} \\in \\mathbb{R}^m$ 是偏置向量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"正如我们在{ref}`activation-functions`中看到的，如果没有非线性激活函数，多层全连接等价于单层。这就是为什么代码中需要使用"
" `F.relu()`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:56
msgid "为什么堆叠多层有用？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:58
msgid ""
"单层全连接（$y = Wx + "
"b$）只能学习**线性决策边界**——在特征空间中画一条直线或超平面。但现实中大多数问题（手写数字识别、图像分类）的决策边界是高度非线性的。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:60
msgid "多层堆叠 + 非线性激活解决了这个问题："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:62
msgid "**每层变换空间**：$Wx + b$ 对特征空间做旋转、缩放、平移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**激活函数折叠空间**：{ref}`activation-functions` 中我们看到，ReLU 将负区域\"压平\"到 "
"0，实现了空间的非线性折叠"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:64
msgid "**层数越多，边界越复杂**：第一层学直线，第二层组合直线成简单形状，第三层组合形状成复杂边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:66
msgid "3个神经元就能画出复杂边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`decision-boundary` 一节展示了一个惊人的例子：仅用 **3 "
"个隐藏层神经元**就能划分出任意复杂的不规则区域。每个神经元定义一个\"软\"半平面，通过乘法（$n_2 \\times (n_1 + "
"n_3)$）实现**门控机制**——一个神经元充当\"开关\"控制其他神经元的输出是否生效。少量神经元的非线性组合就能逼近几乎任何形状的决策边界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:71
msgid "这就是多层感知机（MLP）的核心能力：**用简单线性单元的层级组合表达任意复杂的函数**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:75
msgid "**全连接层的威力**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:77
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{3层全连接} = \\text{ReLU}(W_3 \\cdot \\text{ReLU}(W_2 \\cdot "
"\\text{ReLU}(W_1 x + b_1) + b_2) + b_3)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:81
msgid "每一层 $W_i x + b_i$ 做线性变换，每一层 ReLU 引入非线性折叠。三层叠在一起，理论上可以逼近任何连续函数（通用近似定理）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:83
msgid "这正是全连接网络的核心矛盾：**表达能力极强（可以学任何函数），但参数效率极低（什么先验都不假设）**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:86
msgid "参数数量分析"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/fc-layer-basics.md:88
